  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.0.0 - Initial stable release\n\n✨ Features:\n- Complete Protobuf3 support\n- AOT-friendly reflection API\n- JSON serialization support (PascalCase)\n- Zero external dependencies\n- NativeAOT compilation support\n- High performance with zero runtime overhead\n\n🔧 Supported Types:\n- All primitive types (double, float, int32, int64, uint32, uint64, etc.)\n- Complex types (repeated, oneof, map<K,V>)\n- Nested messages and enums\n- Full serialization/deserialization\n\n🚀 Performance:\n- Compile-time code generation\n- Static dispatch and inlining\n- Immutable data structures\n- Thread-safe operations",
